{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q27266813","formula":"C₂₀H₃₂N₂O","hill":"C20H32N2O","elements":["H","C","N","O"],"composition":{"C":20.0,"H":32.0,"N":2.0,"O":1.0},"names":{"en":"Methyldiazinol"},"descriptions":{"en":"Methyldiazinol (also known as 3,3-azo-17α-methyl-5α-dihydrotestosterone, 3-azi-17α-methyl-DHT, or 3,3-azo-17α-methyl-5α-androstan-17β-ol) is a synthetic and orally active androgen/anabolic steroid (AAS) which was never marketed. It is a 17α-methylated derivative of dihydrotestosterone (DHT); specifically, it is the C3 azi (i.e., 3,3-azo) analogue of mestanolone (17α-methyl-DHT). The drug has been found to possess a high ratio and dissociation of myotrophic to androgenic activity; relative to methyltestosterone, its ratio was 15 (3:0.2), among the highest observed."},"fame":1,"pubchemCid":112500385,"mass":316.5,"charge":0,"smiles":"C[C@]12CCC3(C[C@@H]1CC[C@@H]4[C@@H]2CC[C@]5([C@H]4CC[C@]5(C)O)C)N=N3","inchikey":"LMNFACKYKJIJHJ-PHFHYRSDSA-N","iupac":"(5S,8R,9S,10S,13S,14S,17S)-10,13,17-trimethylspiro[2,4,5,6,7,8,9,11,12,14,15,16-dodecahydro-1H-cyclopenta[a]phenanthrene-3,3'-diazirine]-17-ol","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"rdkit","ref":"112500385","atoms":55,"license":"Computed with RDKit from SMILES (PubChem, Wikidata)"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":2.229,"y":-1.695,"z":0.197,"el":"C"},{"x":2.0,"y":-0.322,"z":-0.484,"el":"C"},{"x":2.681,"y":-0.346,"z":-1.886,"el":"C"},{"x":4.21,"y":-0.432,"z":-1.826,"el":"C"},{"x":4.775,"y":0.616,"z":-0.92,"el":"C"},{"x":4.168,"y":0.738,"z":0.445,"el":"C"},{"x":2.64,"y":0.853,"z":0.331,"el":"C"},{"x":1.991,"y":1.035,"z":1.706,"el":"C"},{"x":0.491,"y":1.289,"z":1.577,"el":"C"},{"x":-0.22,"y":0.194,"z":0.768,"el":"C"},{"x":0.462,"y":-0.015,"z":-0.623,"el":"C"},{"x":-0.316,"y":-1.025,"z":-1.506,"el":"C"},{"x":-1.821,"y":-0.712,"z":-1.605,"el":"C"},{"x":-2.468,"y